      "derivation_trace": "Floyd-Warshall 或 Dijkstra 全源求解，边权 w_e 为路段行驶时间。",
      "sub_question_binding": "Q1"
    },
    {
      "equation_id": "E2",
      "latex": "R_j(T_0) = \\{ i : t_{ij} \\le T_0 \\}, \\quad \\mathcal{U} = \\{ i : \\min_j t_{ij} > T_0 \\}",
      "type": "逻辑",
      "variables_refs": [
        "V3",
        "V4"
      ],
      "derivation_trace": "时间半径覆盖集定义，未覆盖节点为所有平台半径外的节点。",
      "sub_question_binding": "Q1"
    },
    {
      "equation_id": "E3",
      "latex": "\\mathcal{T}_b = \\min_Y \\max_{k} \\sum_j t_{jk} y_{jk},\\quad s.t.\\ \\sum_k y_{jk} \\le 1,\\ \\sum_j y_{jk} = 1",
      "type": "逻辑",
      "variables_refs": [
        "V5",
        "V6"
      ],
      "derivation_trace": "瓶颈指派的标准形式，用二分搜索加匹配检验求解。",
      "sub_question_binding": "Q2"
    },
    {
      "equation_id": "E4",
      "latex": "\\Delta\\eta(Z) = \\frac{|\\mathcal{U}| - |\\mathcal{U}(Z)|}{|\\mathcal{U}|}，覆盖缺口消减率",
      "type": "代数",
      "variables_refs": [
        "V4",
        "V7",
        "V8"
      ],
      "derivation_trace": "新增平台的效果用覆盖缺口消减率度量，选择使 Δη 最大的位置组合。",
      "sub_question_binding": "Q3"
    },
    {
      "equation_id": "E5",
      "latex": "\\kappa = \\frac{\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_j (L_j - \\bar{L})^2}}{\\bar{L}}, \\quad L_j = \\sum_{i: c_i = j} \\deg(i)",
      "type": "代数",
      "variables_refs": [
        "V9"
      ],
      "derivation_trace": "平台负载用管辖节点度数之和度量，变异系数衡量工作量均衡。",
      "sub_question_binding": "Q4"
    },
    {
      "equation_id": "E6",
      "latex": "\\mathcal{A}(\\tau) = \\{ \\xi : t_{P,\\xi} \\le \\tau \\}, \\quad \\tau_e = \\min\\{ \\tau : \\forall \\xi \\in \\partial\\mathcal{A}(\\tau),\\ \\min_j t_{j,\\xi} \\le \\tau - \\tau_0 \\}",
      "type": "逻辑",
      "variables_refs": [
        "V10",
        "V11",
        "V12"
      ],
      "derivation_trace": "嫌疑犯可达前缘随时间扩张，闭合时刻是前缘每个出口都被警车先到覆盖的最早时刻。",
      "sub_question_binding": "Q5"
    }
